; Table: Display Records By Moved Marker
;
; One word for each moved marker, after #R$C583 keeps bits 0-6.
; #R$E497, #R$E5D8, #R$E5FD, #R$E5AD, #R$F210, #R$F203, #R$EB8B,
; #R$ED28, #R$F1D6, #R$EB9B, #R$EDE9, #R$EDDD and #R$F2A5.
; Read by #R$C583.
@label=Table_DisplayRecordsByMovedMarker
w$9FAB DEFW $E497
 $9FAD DEFW $E5D8
 $9FAF DEFW $E5FD
 $9FB1 DEFW $E5AD
 $9FB3 DEFW $F210
 $9FB5 DEFW $F203
 $9FB7 DEFW $EB8B
 $9FB9 DEFW $ED28
